---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import Breadcrumbs from "../components/Breadcrumbs.astro"; import { site } from "../config/site"; import { breadcrumbSchema } from "../utils/schema";
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Cookie Notice | Hello Honey Bunny" description="How Hello Honey Bunny handles enquiry details, cookies, Google Analytics and advertising measurement choices." canonicalPath="/privacy" schema={breadcrumbSchema([{name:"Home",path:"/"},{name:"Privacy",path:"/privacy"}])}><main id="main"><Breadcrumbs items={[{name:"Home",path:"/"},{name:"Privacy"}]} /><section class="page-intro"><div class="narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Website information</p><h1>Privacy and cookie notice</h1><p class="lede">This static website lets you prepare an enquiry for WhatsApp or email and gives you control over optional measurement.</p></div></section><section class="section section-cream"><div class="narrow"><h2>Enquiry information</h2><p>Form values are processed in your browser to format your request. They are transferred only when you continue to WhatsApp or your email service and send the message. This website has no backend or CRM and does not itself store enquiries. Optional marketing permission is separate from submitting an enquiry and is unchecked by default.</p><h2>Cookie categories</h2><h3>Essential</h3><p>Essential browser storage remembers your cookie choices and supports security. It is always enabled.</p><h3>Analytics</h3><p>With your permission, Google Analytics helps us understand page visits and interactions. Google Analytics event data is retained for 14 months. We do not send names, email addresses, telephone numbers, form answers, messages, account identifiers or sensitive URL query values.</p><h3>Advertising measurement</h3><p>With your permission, Google advertising storage and user-data signals may measure whether an advertisement led to a website action. We do not upload contact details as ordinary analytics data. A handoff to WhatsApp or email is not treated as a confirmed lead.</p><h3>Personalized marketing</h3><p>With your separate permission, Google may use advertising personalization signals. This remains off when you reject optional cookies or leave this category unselected.</p><h2>Consent Mode and providers</h2><p>Google Consent Mode v2 starts analytics storage, advertising storage, advertising user data and advertising personalization as denied. The Google tag may send limited, cookieless consent and measurement signals while storage is denied. Optional storage is enabled only after your choice. Google’s own privacy terms apply to its processing.</p><h2>Changing your choice</h2><p>Use the permanent <strong>Cookie settings</strong> button in the footer at any time. Rejecting all keeps every optional category denied.</p><h2>Other services</h2><p>WhatsApp or Meta may process a message after you continue to WhatsApp. Your email provider and the recipient's email provider may process an email after you send it. Their own terms and privacy practices apply.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or by WhatsApp at <a href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsappNumber}`}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p></div></section></main></BaseLayout>
